# RFC 0038, section 1: what libweavec_rt exports. Each line is a symbol
# (its C name), and a platform (darwin, linux) when only that platform
# defines it, or linux-if-defined when the runtime defines it only where
# the C library does; everything else the runtime defines is hidden.
# scripts/check-hygiene.py checks the list against weavec_rt.h and the
# definitions marked WEAVEC_RT_API.

